  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help us preserve Georgia&apos;s heritage &amp; landscapes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Georgia possesses hundreds of historic sites worthy of saving and promoting, but lacks sufficient resources and skills. It has a highly distinctive culture and depends financially on its tourism.  The National Trust of Georgia provides practical support &amp; sustainable methods of preserving Georgia&apos;s historic built environment and landscape. We support major restoration projects, provide workshops, consultation and advice to private owners, local neighborhoods, developers, &amp; other organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
